          "quote": "Let $A,B,A',B'$ be nonzero finite-dimensional complex inner-product spaces, let $\\rho_{AB}$ be a density operator on $A\\otimes B$, and let $\\Phi:A\\to A'$ and $\\Psi:B\\to B'$ be quantum channels. Then\n\n$$I(A':B')_{(\\Phi\\otimes\\Psi)(\\rho)}\\le I(A:B)_\\rho,$$\n\nwhere quantum mutual information is $I(X:Y)_\\omega=S(\\omega_X)+S(\\omega_Y)-S(\\omega_{XY})$ as in [[def-it-finite-quantum-information-measures]].",
