          "source": "thm-it-quantum-relative-entropy-nonnegative-equality",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "For density operators $\\rho,\\sigma$ on a finite-dimensional complex inner-product space,\n\n$$D(\\rho\\|\\sigma)\\ge0,$$\n\nwith equality if and only if $\\rho=\\sigma$.",
          "uses": [
